"""Compose and launch the simulator's Qt main window.

``MainWindow`` owns session state and installs runtime UI components, then
delegates navigation, layer editing, simulation execution, and plotting to the
presentation controllers. Validation and numerical behavior remain outside
this entry-point module.
"""

